# 統一換行處理，避免 Windows / Linux 協作與 CI 之間的雜訊 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批次檔必須是 CRLF，否則 cmd.exe 可能解析失敗
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 二進位
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff2 binary
*.gguf  binary
*.zip   binary
*.db    binary

# GitHub 語言統計：不要把文件與測試算成主要語言
docs/**    linguist-documentation
tests/**   linguist-documentation
